n it!\n\nThat’s the last thing I expected!\nGuess what Professor Elm said to him.\n\n...\n\"It seems that your Pokémon already\nlikes you so much.\n\nFor a Pokémon, the best happiness is\nto be with someone it loves.\n\nI think it should stay with you.\"\n\n...\nIsn’t it moving? It made me cry!","id":"61-6-0-block-0","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":true,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-16a","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"aide","trigger":"scene","condition":"var 0x40FC=2","source":"843 S#16; 543 m56"}]}],"kind":"element","gender":"both","legacyNames":["The aide's news about the thief"]},{"id":"61-7","name":"Scene When You Come Back With Eight Badges","events":["NBT-EVT-061-15"],"context":"[NBT-EVT-061-15]\n\n","points":[{"id":"61-7-0","condition":"probably stage H, the first time you walk into the lab then. Your friend walks up to you.","stages":["H"],"ids":["NBT-DLG-061-15a","NBT-DLG-061-15f","NBT-DLG-061-15b","NBT-DLG-061-15g","NBT-DLG-061-15c","NBT-DLG-061-15h","NBT-DLG-061-15d","NBT-DLG-061-15i","NBT-DLG-061-15e","NBT-DLG-061-15j"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","text":"(boy player, probably)","id":"61-7-0-block-0","gender":"male"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Lyra: [Player]!\nDid you already collect eight Badges?\n\nThat’s so cool!\n\nThe professor is waiting\nfor you.","id":"61-7-0-block-1","gender":"male"},{"type":"note","text":"(girl player, probably)","id":"61-7-0-block-2","gender":"female"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Ethan: [Player]!\nDid you already collect eight Badges?\n\nThat’s so cool!\n\nThe professor is waiting\nfor you.","id":"61-7-0-block-3","gender":"female"},{"type":"note","text":"You both walk up to Elm. Boy and girl players hear the same words from him. You receive a Master Ball; if your Bag is full you do not get it, the same lines still play, and it is not offered again.","id":"61-7-0-block-4","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: Hi, [Player]!\nYou never cease to amaze me!\n\nThanks to you, my research is\n