 01a","source":"843 F#2; 543 m72"}]},{"id":"61-11-12","condition":"a certain point in the story has been reached (what causes it is not confirmed), you do not have the Everstone yet, and your lead Pokémon is a Togepi, Togetic or Togekiss. Which middle part plays depends on another event that could not be identified.","stages":[],"ids":["NBT-DLG-061-01d","NBT-DLG-061-01e","NBT-DLG-061-01ai","NBT-DLG-061-01f","NBT-DLG-061-01aj","NBT-DLG-061-01h","NBT-DLG-061-01i","NBT-DLG-061-01al"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: What?\nThat Pokémon!?","id":"61-11-12-block-0","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"Either:","id":"61-11-12-block-1","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Hmm...\nAs far as I know, there is not a\n\nPokémon like this in Johto...\n\nJust like Mr. Pokémon was saying\nover the phone...\n\nThe legendary Pokémon could be...\nOh, never mind.\n\nAnyway, I’m sure things will be\nhappening around you, [Player]!\n\nYou are making me all excited!\nI’ll give you a present for that.\n\nPlease take it.","id":"61-11-12-block-2","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"or:","id":"61-11-12-block-3","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Hmm...\nAs far as I know, there are no\n\nPokémon like this at Johto...\n\nJust like Mr. Pokémon was saying\nover the phone.\n\nYou seem to be there when\nsomething exciting happens,\n\n[Player]!\n\nYou are making me all excited!\nI’ll give you a present for that.\n\nPlease take it.","id":"61-11-12-block-4","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"You receive an Everstone (if your Bag is full you get nothing and he tries again next time). Then:","id":"61-11-12-block-5","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: That’s an Everstone.\n\nA Pokémon changes its shape as\nit evolves.\n\nBut if it’s holding an Everstone,\nyou can prevent it from evolving.\n\nIf you like the way a Pokémon is now,\nhave it hold an Everstone!\n\nProfessor Elm: [Player], good luck\nwith your journey!\n\nOh, one more thing...\nDon’t forget about my research!","id":"61-11-12-block-6","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":true,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01d","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"talk (F#39)","condition":"flag 114 clear, 2435 set, lead is Togepi line","source":"843 F#39; 543 m46"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01e","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"talk (F#60/#68); male","condition":"after 01d; flag 264 / 265 clear","source":"843 F#60,#68; 543 m47"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01ai","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"as 01e; female","condition":"as 01e","source":"843 F#60,#68; 543 m48"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01f","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"talk (F#39/#59); male","condition":"after 01d; flag 264 / 265 set","source":"843 F#39,#59; 543 m104"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01aj","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"as 01f; female","condition":"as 01f","source":"843 F#39,#59; 543 m105"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01h","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"after Everstone given (F#68/#69)","condition":"item space for Everstone","source":"843 F#68,#69; 543 m49"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01i","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"after 01h; male","condition":"as 01h","source":"843 F#68,#69; 543 m50"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01al","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"as 01i; female","condition":"as 01h","source":"843 F#68,#69; 543 m51"}]},{"id":"61-11-13","condition":"the same point in the story, no Everstone yet, but your lead Pokémon is not a Togepi, Togetic or Togekiss. He then goes on to one of the late lines above, most likely \"I’d love to take a look at the Pokémon that hatched\".","stages":[],"ids":["NBT-DLG-061-01g","NBT-DLG-061-01ak"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: [Player]?\nI thought the Egg hatched.\n\nWhere is the Pokémon?","id":"61-11-13-block-0","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"**The Spiky-eared Pichu.** If the lead Pokémon that can still fight is a Pichu with a spiky ear, Elm has these lines instead of his usual ones (the S.S. Ticket scene still comes first). Words shown in colour in the game are written in plain text here.","id":"61-11-13-block-1","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":false,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01g","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"talk (F#40); male","condition":"flag 114 clear, 2435 set, lead not Togepi line","source":"843 F#40; 543 m53"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01ak","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"as 01g; female","condition":"as 01g","source":"843 F#40; 543 m54"}]},{"id":"61-11-14","condition":"the first time he sees it. He and your Pokémon walk about while he looks at it.","stages":[],"ids":["NBT-DLG-061-01s","NBT-DLG-061-01as","NBT-DLG-061-01t","NBT-DLG-061-01u","NBT-DLG-061-01v","NBT-DLG-061-01w","NBT-DLG-061-01x","NBT-DLG-061-01y","NBT-DLG-061-01z","NBT-DLG-061-01at"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: Hi, [Player]!","id":"61-11-14-block-0","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: That is quite a\nrare PICHU!\n\nCan I take a look at it closely?\n\nHmm...\nOne of the ears is spiky...\n\nThat’s strange.\n\nThere seems to be something more to it.\n\nIt really is a rare sight.\n\nYou met it at the Ilex Forest?\n\nA mysterious Pokémon called CELEBI\nhas been sighted there, or so I heard.\n\nSpeaking of that...\n\nProfessor Oak once wrote about\nCELEBI and Time Travel in a research\n\npaper he presented at a conference!\n\nProfessor Elm: CELEBI can use its\nmystic power called Time Travel...to\n\ntravel to the past and future.\n\nIf this PICHU has traveled through\ntime, perhaps you should take\n\nextra care of it, [Player].\n\nIt seems that this PICHU has been\naffected by traveling so far through\n\ntime with CELEBI.\n\nI’ll i